WEBVTT

00:00:06.750 --> 00:00:09.060
Let's begin the investigation-daVinci!

00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:12.070
The clues are... here, and here!

00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:16.310
Sakaida Kakiemon created the wood block printing revolution!

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:19.460
This was her face 10 years ago-daVinci!

00:00:25.820 --> 00:00:27.480
Everyone pay attention-pri!

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:29.100
You'll lose out if you don't-pri!

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:31.650
You'll forget all about CelePara after hearing this!

00:00:31.650 --> 00:00:35.000
Underground Pripara,
shortened as UndPara is now open-pri!

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:37.390
Come and see our amazing concerts-pri!

00:00:37.390 --> 00:00:39.100
We'll be singing our hearts out!

00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:42.160
You can only hear my amazing voice at UndPara!

00:00:42.160 --> 00:00:43.660
Please come!

00:00:44.630 --> 00:00:46.790
Won't we get told off for going there?

00:00:48.050 --> 00:00:49.340
"Don't worry"

00:00:49.670 --> 00:00:52.600
Shikyouin-dono said that outside of the Grand Prix,

00:00:52.600 --> 00:00:54.970
we're allowed to do as we please.

00:00:55.300 --> 00:00:56.640
That includes Sophie too.

00:00:57.090 --> 00:00:58.370
Underground PriPara?

00:00:58.830 --> 00:01:02.930
I heard SoLaMi SMILE, Dressing Pafe
and Aromageddon will be there too!

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:04.000
Really?

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:06.390
But, CelePara is on right now.

00:01:06.680 --> 00:01:08.150
Yeah...

00:01:08.600 --> 00:01:09.780
Y-You guys!

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:14.280
Don't get discouraged from the get go-pri!

00:01:15.100 --> 00:01:16.110
You're right.

00:01:16.110 --> 00:01:18.580
Pop Step Please come-pri!

00:01:19.940 --> 00:01:20.790
Huh?

00:01:21.100 --> 00:01:22.160
Hanana-chan?

00:02:53.540 --> 00:02:58.070
I Became
an Underground Idol

00:02:58.700 --> 00:02:59.850
Hanana-chan?

00:03:00.060 --> 00:03:02.300
H-Hello, Lala-chan.

00:03:02.300 --> 00:03:03.750
Hey-pri!

00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:05.170
We're gonna do a concert at UndPara.

00:03:05.170 --> 00:03:06.490
Please come-pri!

00:03:06.730 --> 00:03:07.760
S-Sure.

00:03:07.760 --> 00:03:08.730
There you are!

00:03:08.730 --> 00:03:10.410
Hanana what are you doing?

00:03:11.050 --> 00:03:13.610
I'm heading to UndPara

00:03:13.610 --> 00:03:14.640
Huh?

00:03:14.810 --> 00:03:18.400
At Undpara they only have tap water,
it seems they don't even have sparkling water.

00:03:18.950 --> 00:03:21.790
What's up with that?
There's nothing wrong with tap water.

00:03:21.790 --> 00:03:23.610
Dorothy, relax.

00:03:23.610 --> 00:03:24.780
Hurry up!

00:03:24.780 --> 00:03:26.750
The CelePara concert will start soon!

00:03:27.060 --> 00:03:27.880
B-But...

00:03:27.880 --> 00:03:29.680
Panet Jackson is performing today!

00:03:29.680 --> 00:03:31.740
Cool, she's an internationally famous idol right?

00:03:31.740 --> 00:03:32.780
Hanana...

00:03:32.780 --> 00:03:34.880
CelePara Shmele Para-pri!

00:03:34.880 --> 00:03:37.240
Our concerts are <i>so</i> much better-pri!

00:03:38.190 --> 00:03:40.230
Please take one-pri!

00:03:40.230 --> 00:03:42.570
Please come to UndPara!

00:03:42.870 --> 00:03:46.090
Come see the special performance of the future Divine Idol Dorothy!

00:03:46.090 --> 00:03:47.720
It'll be really fun!

00:03:57.800 --> 00:03:59.380
What rank is today's guest?

00:04:01.040 --> 00:04:03.270
A top class international idol.

00:04:03.270 --> 00:04:05.600
This is what a concert should be.

00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:09.800
A true talent shining,

00:04:09.800 --> 00:04:12.110
with everyone else looking up to them.

00:04:12.860 --> 00:04:15.720
Only an idiot would leave a diamond in the rough.

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:17.850
It should be taken out,

00:04:17.850 --> 00:04:21.030
and appreciated for its true value.

00:04:21.830 --> 00:04:24.480
And from that, true emotions can be experienced.

00:04:34.900 --> 00:04:35.740
Maho-chan.

00:04:36.890 --> 00:04:37.740
What's wrong?

00:04:38.250 --> 00:04:39.540
Have you seen Garuru?

00:04:39.800 --> 00:04:42.080
She was staying in my room,

00:04:42.080 --> 00:04:43.970
but she's not there.

00:04:43.970 --> 00:04:44.720
Garuru?

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:46.350
Don't bite her!

00:04:48.300 --> 00:04:52.050
Ahh, that little princess.

00:04:52.050 --> 00:04:53.960
Come to UndPara-garu!

00:04:54.320 --> 00:04:55.780
Garuru will be doing a concert!

00:04:55.780 --> 00:04:57.540
Please come and see-garu!

00:04:57.750 --> 00:05:00.640
Well if it isn't the Monster Idol...

00:05:00.640 --> 00:05:01.280
Garu?

00:05:01.540 --> 00:05:04.510
Refrain from toiling so-dearu.

00:05:04.510 --> 00:05:06.520
She's saying she wants to help-nano!

00:05:06.520 --> 00:05:07.410
Garu!

00:05:08.010 --> 00:05:10.990
Garuru, won't you have a duel with us?

00:05:10.990 --> 00:05:11.660
Garu?

00:05:11.960 --> 00:05:15.800
Demon or Monster, who can hand out the most flyers?

00:05:15.800 --> 00:05:17.680
I won't lose-garu!

00:05:17.890 --> 00:05:20.610
Okay? Ready, go-nano!

00:05:20.980 --> 00:05:23.870
The Cursed Banquet at UndPara is beginning!

00:05:23.870 --> 00:05:26.600
It's the all-natural Monster Concert-garu!

00:05:26.600 --> 00:05:28.460
You should be my captive!

00:05:28.460 --> 00:05:30.260
The Great UndPara War-garu!

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:31.690
It'll be so much fun.

00:05:31.690 --> 00:05:32.970
Please come everyone-nano!

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:35.550
96, 97

00:05:35.550 --> 00:05:36.880
Only 100 left for today,

00:05:36.880 --> 00:05:38.750
no, I'll make 200-kuma!

00:05:39.340 --> 00:05:41.350
I can't believe that...

00:05:41.350 --> 00:05:44.440
an elite manager like me has to make flyers underground-usa.

00:05:44.440 --> 00:05:46.380
It'll be fine-nekon.

00:05:48.630 --> 00:05:50.340
Just keep falling from grace.

00:05:51.400 --> 00:05:53.550
Because then the only way is up,

00:05:53.550 --> 00:05:55.600
isn't that amazing-nekon?

00:05:55.910 --> 00:05:57.070
She's right-kuma!

00:05:57.070 --> 00:06:00.640
Even if Lala and Mirei can't do concerts at CelePara,

00:06:00.640 --> 00:06:03.110
they can start again at UndPara-kuma!

00:06:03.110 --> 00:06:05.300
My Aroma and Mikan can too-nekon.

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:07.670
And Dorothy and Leona can too, right-nekon?

00:06:08.890 --> 00:06:10.780
You're right-usa...

00:06:10.780 --> 00:06:13.340
Supporting Idols who are giving it their all,

00:06:13.340 --> 00:06:15.120
that's a managers true duty.

00:06:15.120 --> 00:06:16.680
Despite that,

00:06:16.680 --> 00:06:20.180
I'm sat here complaining about myself, what am I doing-usa!?

00:06:22.320 --> 00:06:25.700
How can I call myself an elite manager
when I'm sitting here moping-usa!?

00:06:25.700 --> 00:06:29.420
A spring is at it's strongest when it's oppressed-usa!

00:06:29.420 --> 00:06:31.100
It's almost time for a concert-usa!

00:06:31.100 --> 00:06:33.380
Kuma, come help me set up-usa!

00:06:33.380 --> 00:06:34.320
Hey!

00:06:34.320 --> 00:06:35.810
You're the one who's helping me-kuma!

00:06:35.810 --> 00:06:37.700
What a recovery!
You're the one who's helping me-kuma!

00:06:37.930 --> 00:06:40.430
Boys are so simple-nekon...

00:06:40.780 --> 00:06:43.620
But that's what I like about them-nekon.

00:06:44.060 --> 00:06:45.170
Although...

00:06:47.170 --> 00:06:50.780
I stack another one...

00:06:50.780 --> 00:06:52.710
for Fuwari...

00:06:53.660 --> 00:06:58.600
And another one, for Fuwari.

00:06:58.600 --> 00:07:02.430
And one more, for Fuwari.

00:07:02.430 --> 00:07:04.860
What on earth has happened here-nekon?

00:07:07.290 --> 00:07:09.280
It'd be best for you not to come-dearu!

00:07:09.280 --> 00:07:11.430
It's the Idol Attack-garu!

00:07:11.430 --> 00:07:13.530
It's the Grand UndPara unveiling-nano!

00:07:13.530 --> 00:07:14.760
Please come!

00:07:15.670 --> 00:07:17.500
It's UndPara around here?

00:07:18.320 --> 00:07:20.220
I'll take you-nano!

00:07:21.440 --> 00:07:22.750
Here it is-nano!

00:07:39.550 --> 00:07:43.630
Amazing, they're actually doing concerts!

00:07:51.060 --> 00:07:53.750
Only fifty?

00:07:53.750 --> 00:07:54.640
Dorothy.

00:07:54.640 --> 00:07:56.870
We only had fifty fans!

00:07:57.230 --> 00:07:58.480
It's perfect!

00:07:58.480 --> 00:07:59.460
Yeah-pri!

00:07:59.460 --> 00:08:02.880
If we get more fans, we'll get more likes-pri!

00:08:02.880 --> 00:08:03.450
Yeah.

00:08:03.450 --> 00:08:07.330
So we need to do more concerts and get more fans!

00:08:07.930 --> 00:08:08.800
Lala-chan!

00:08:10.080 --> 00:08:11.170
Hanana-chan!

00:08:11.510 --> 00:08:12.640
You came!

00:08:12.640 --> 00:08:13.970
I'm so glad.

00:08:14.260 --> 00:08:15.470
Thank you capisce!

00:08:15.870 --> 00:08:17.580
Welcome to UndPara-pri!

00:08:17.580 --> 00:08:18.440
Thanks,

00:08:18.440 --> 00:08:21.600
I knew that I wanted to see Lala-chan and her friend's concerts.

00:08:22.120 --> 00:08:23.520
That's great!

00:08:23.760 --> 00:08:26.110
We'll do plenty of concerts, so look forward to them!

00:09:07.200 --> 00:09:08.760
Lala-chan!

00:09:08.760 --> 00:09:11.460
I love SoLaMi SMILE!

00:09:11.460 --> 00:09:14.510
Even though you can't enter the Spring Dream Gran Prix, give it your all!

00:09:14.510 --> 00:09:15.580
Capisce!

00:09:15.580 --> 00:09:16.280
Pri!

00:09:22.000 --> 00:09:25.570
It should be around here-daVinci...

00:09:29.720 --> 00:09:32.830
It hasn't changed in 10 years-daVinci!

00:09:32.990 --> 00:09:36.590
There's a secret entrance if I remember correctly.

00:09:36.590 --> 00:09:38.610
It's over here-daVinci!

00:09:42.990 --> 00:09:43.910
Ajimi.

00:09:51.590 --> 00:09:54.480
Auguste Rodin!

00:09:54.480 --> 00:09:56.030
The nostalgia!

00:09:56.030 --> 00:10:00.450
All the fruit like oranges and peaches used to grow in summer!

00:10:00.610 --> 00:10:06.240
Bunches of rare fruit from the southern countries grew in the greenhouse!

00:10:06.530 --> 00:10:11.410
When I was little,
I used to eat so many of them!

00:10:11.410 --> 00:10:13.050
Hey, who are you!?

00:10:14.620 --> 00:10:16.570
The gardener!

00:10:17.000 --> 00:10:18.590
Long time no see!

00:10:19.480 --> 00:10:20.530
Who are you?

00:10:22.000 --> 00:10:23.310
Fruit thief!

00:10:23.990 --> 00:10:26.590
Have you come to steal fruit again?

00:10:27.440 --> 00:10:29.920
I'll do that later.

00:10:29.920 --> 00:10:32.160
Today I just have something to ask you-daVinci.

00:10:32.160 --> 00:10:33.330
Something to ask me?

00:10:34.080 --> 00:10:35.070
This girl!

00:10:35.070 --> 00:10:36.820
She used to live here-daVinci.

00:10:36.820 --> 00:10:39.130
I used to call her "Curly-chan"

00:10:39.130 --> 00:10:41.730
but I never knew what her real name was-utrillo.

00:10:42.680 --> 00:10:45.480
It's Princess Hibiki when she was younger.

00:10:45.480 --> 00:10:46.960
You sure drew her well.

00:10:46.960 --> 00:10:47.650
Hibiki!

00:10:47.860 --> 00:10:51.880
I never knew you saw her so much, constantly being in and out.

00:10:52.520 --> 00:10:54.200
How nostalgic.

00:10:54.400 --> 00:10:57.830
She hasn't lived at this villa for the past ten years.

00:10:58.460 --> 00:11:01.890
Ah, she became the Mister Universe

00:11:01.890 --> 00:11:03.160
Prince of the Year!

00:11:08.570 --> 00:11:10.630
Yeah!

00:11:10.630 --> 00:11:13.640
I knew Hibiki was Curly-chan-daVinci!

00:11:16.800 --> 00:11:19.370
How ominous,

00:11:19.370 --> 00:11:20.370
Ando.

00:11:24.440 --> 00:11:26.320
By the way Hibiki-sama,

00:11:26.320 --> 00:11:29.220
it appears that an underground PriPara has been founded.

00:11:29.900 --> 00:11:31.770
They're distributing flyers.

00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:33.870
Ah, UndPara?

00:11:34.280 --> 00:11:35.170
Leave them be.

00:11:35.520 --> 00:11:37.590
They're no match for CelePara.

00:11:39.300 --> 00:11:43.790
Idols will come to CelePara, I know it.

00:11:46.260 --> 00:11:48.790
All is right with the world.

00:11:52.290 --> 00:11:55.230
Garuru will most certainly come to UndPara.

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:07.410
Garuru has improved again.

00:13:08.690 --> 00:13:11.020
We'll take you to heaven!

00:13:11.020 --> 00:13:12.630
No, hell!

00:13:15.170 --> 00:13:17.950
I'll steal all your hearts-pri!

00:13:20.650 --> 00:13:23.130
Everyone have fun capisce!

00:13:27.230 --> 00:13:28.870
Hanana-chan, you come too!

00:13:29.110 --> 00:13:31.360
Eh? But...

00:13:31.360 --> 00:13:34.830
I'm just a new experimental idol...

00:13:34.830 --> 00:13:36.000
No problem!

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:40.200
This is UndPara, we're all friends, we're all idols!

00:13:40.200 --> 00:13:41.210
Yeah!

00:13:41.210 --> 00:13:43.520
But I don't have a manager...

00:13:45.290 --> 00:13:47.040
Hanana-san, take him.

00:13:51.240 --> 00:13:52.920
Hanana-san's solo debut concert.

00:13:53.320 --> 00:13:54.570
Give it your all!

00:14:15.930 --> 00:14:17.190
Hanana-chan!

00:14:17.190 --> 00:14:19.470
Pop Step Perfect-pri!

00:14:19.920 --> 00:14:22.390
Thanks Lala-chan, everyone!

00:14:22.390 --> 00:14:24.050
Thank you UndPara!

00:14:26.720 --> 00:14:29.610
Hanana-san,
you've ranked up from Sparkling Experimental Idol

00:14:29.610 --> 00:14:32.030
to Novice Experimental Idol!

00:14:32.030 --> 00:14:33.360
Congratulations.

00:14:33.920 --> 00:14:35.430
That was so fun!

00:14:35.430 --> 00:14:37.490
CelePara is the best!

00:14:37.490 --> 00:14:39.770
I'd expect no less from international idols!

00:14:40.050 --> 00:14:42.170
Today's concert was great too!

00:14:42.170 --> 00:14:43.280
It sure was!

00:14:43.280 --> 00:14:45.950
It was so cool I feel like I've had my fill!

00:14:45.950 --> 00:14:48.410
That's the true meaning of sparkling!

00:14:49.490 --> 00:14:53.110
But... we're only watching...

00:14:54.360 --> 00:14:55.500
She's right...

00:14:55.850 --> 00:15:00.220
Only Top Class idols and above can perform in CelePara.

00:15:01.530 --> 00:15:03.660
Wanna go to UndPara?

00:15:04.440 --> 00:15:05.580
Yeah!

00:15:05.580 --> 00:15:08.080
We can perform too in UndPara!

00:15:08.820 --> 00:15:09.460
Let's go!

00:15:11.490 --> 00:15:14.070
UndPara sounds fun, right?

00:15:14.400 --> 00:15:16.590
I want to show it to you.

00:15:17.050 --> 00:15:19.600
There's been so many concerts today

00:15:19.800 --> 00:15:23.070
Kuma-san, Usagi-san and even Neko-neesan

00:15:23.070 --> 00:15:26.400
have all been supporting us!

00:15:26.730 --> 00:15:29.130
Toriko-san is her usual self,

00:15:29.130 --> 00:15:31.060
but I'm sure she'll come around.

00:15:32.080 --> 00:15:33.530
Although only a little,

00:15:33.530 --> 00:15:37.170
fans and performers are coming in greater numbers

00:15:37.170 --> 00:15:39.120
and are having fun and doing concerts!

00:15:39.890 --> 00:15:42.170
Airy Change!

00:15:47.930 --> 00:15:49.640
Gold Airy!

00:15:50.180 --> 00:15:53.690
And Shion-san got a Gold Airy!

00:15:54.240 --> 00:15:56.370
We've gotta keep up with her!

00:15:59.400 --> 00:16:00.740
See you later, Fuwari.

00:16:01.210 --> 00:16:03.580
Please hurry on back.

00:16:06.810 --> 00:16:08.470
Everyone's giving it their all.

00:16:15.140 --> 00:16:18.950
The countryside air! I love it so much!

00:16:19.150 --> 00:16:22.510
I'm okay just being Fuwari from the Palps!

00:16:25.010 --> 00:16:25.780
Huh?

00:16:32.760 --> 00:16:33.730
What's wrong?

00:16:33.730 --> 00:16:34.900
Oh, Grandpa.

00:16:35.170 --> 00:16:38.460
This one seems a little of, their face is off-color.

00:16:39.260 --> 00:16:41.860
Did you feed him something strange yesterday?

00:16:42.690 --> 00:16:44.060
You did, didn't you?

00:16:44.410 --> 00:16:46.680
Well, I didn't exactly "feed"

00:16:46.680 --> 00:16:49.350
but some wine was left over, so we drank it.

00:16:50.560 --> 00:16:51.530
For goodness sake.

00:16:54.600 --> 00:16:56.460
It's mild dehydration.

00:16:56.820 --> 00:16:58.570
This one too.

00:16:58.570 --> 00:17:00.870
Ah, that one drank beer.

00:17:00.870 --> 00:17:02.400
Grandpa!

00:17:04.410 --> 00:17:07.510
The medicine will be finished soon, be patient.

00:17:08.590 --> 00:17:11.820
You're back to your old self again.

00:17:12.690 --> 00:17:14.820
When you came back from Parajuku

00:17:14.820 --> 00:17:19.460
you'd become a lot weaker.

00:17:19.920 --> 00:17:21.880
Sorry for making you worry,

00:17:21.880 --> 00:17:23.430
but I'm okay now.

00:17:23.860 --> 00:17:26.020
Because I've realized that I'm Fuwari from the Palps.

00:17:26.430 --> 00:17:28.430
I wasn't really suited for PriPara.

00:17:30.040 --> 00:17:36.680
Fuwari, you've always instantly known when an animal was sick since when you were a child.

00:17:37.550 --> 00:17:38.730
Just like now.

00:17:39.840 --> 00:17:45.070
You can read the animal's emotions
just by looking at their faces.

00:17:45.680 --> 00:17:49.660
Did those sharp eyes get blunt with city life at PriPara?

00:17:49.900 --> 00:17:50.930
Grandpa?

00:17:51.280 --> 00:17:56.490
Did you use those eyes to look in to the face of the prince,

00:17:56.490 --> 00:17:59.410
when he told you it was all an act?

00:18:00.230 --> 00:18:04.290
Or did you get complacent in happiness

00:18:04.290 --> 00:18:07.220
when he told you you'd be a princess?

00:18:22.440 --> 00:18:26.350
That was a lie, Hibiki-san's false form.

00:18:26.930 --> 00:18:28.830
I loved you, Fuwari.

00:18:29.650 --> 00:18:30.720
Only you.

00:18:31.600 --> 00:18:34.210
That was a... lie...

00:18:36.110 --> 00:18:38.600
I was busy today so I couldn't speak to you, but

00:18:38.600 --> 00:18:41.870
when you become a lovely princess, I'll come and get you.

00:18:41.870 --> 00:18:44.530
This and that was a lie too.

00:18:45.440 --> 00:18:46.730
All of it was lies.

00:18:47.790 --> 00:18:49.960
I was lonely,

00:18:49.960 --> 00:18:52.760
despite being called prince in this lovely world

00:18:53.490 --> 00:18:55.980
there were no women worthy of courting.

00:18:58.010 --> 00:19:00.950
That was true!

00:19:02.180 --> 00:19:06.260
The lobster is all red and blushing because of your greatness.

00:19:06.260 --> 00:19:07.240
That was a lie.

00:19:07.510 --> 00:19:10.960
Sentences without enders, it cleanses my soul.

00:19:10.960 --> 00:19:13.070
That was really true.

00:19:14.840 --> 00:19:15.740
What's your name?

00:19:18.080 --> 00:19:19.250
Fuwari.

00:19:19.820 --> 00:19:21.160
Midorikaze Fuwari.

00:19:22.130 --> 00:19:23.100
Fuwari...

00:19:24.960 --> 00:19:27.070
I've finally found you...

00:19:28.500 --> 00:19:30.320
My Princess...

00:19:34.040 --> 00:19:36.900
That was the first truth.

00:19:39.310 --> 00:19:40.900
Grandpa, I...

00:19:42.910 --> 00:19:44.780
It seems you've found the answer.

00:19:46.300 --> 00:19:50.350
I want to know more about Hibiki-san and what was true.

00:19:50.730 --> 00:19:51.710
Also,

00:19:53.120 --> 00:19:56.450
I have to make Toriko-san the blue bird of happiness.

00:19:57.950 --> 00:20:01.140
It's obvious at this point that Fuwari's completely forgot about me-tori.

00:20:03.290 --> 00:20:05.430
I'm used to it by now-tori.

00:20:05.850 --> 00:20:07.370
Who will be performing today?

00:20:07.370 --> 00:20:10.220
We're so much closer to the stage than at CelePara.

00:20:10.220 --> 00:20:12.280
Wanna do a concert together?

00:20:12.650 --> 00:20:15.490
Yeah-kuma! Today one hundred people came-kuma!

00:20:15.490 --> 00:20:17.920
Now we can start counting in units of a hundred-nekon!

00:20:17.920 --> 00:20:21.010
It was worth it to make all those leaflets-usa!

00:20:21.010 --> 00:20:23.940
Yeah! Let's go everybody!

00:20:24.330 --> 00:20:27.600
We're all friends, we're all idols!

00:20:29.600 --> 00:20:30.480
UndPara?

00:20:30.480 --> 00:20:33.550
Everyone is having fun and doing concerts,

00:20:33.550 --> 00:20:35.280
won't you come, Maho-chan?

00:20:35.280 --> 00:20:38.780
I have no interest in such fake concerts.

00:20:39.410 --> 00:20:42.870
CelePara is more suiting for you.
